## Publishing

- A push to `main` that changes the documentation publishes the site to <https://docs.lx.e6a.app/{{ docs_tenant }}/>. Such a push is outward-facing.
- Everything in `docs/` is published. It therefore never holds the following (secrets, tokens, personal data, raw captures).
