- A change that alters behaviour, usage or setup also updates the page that covers it. When no page covers it, the change adds one.
- A link between pages has the form `other-page.md`, never `./other-page` or a full URL. `uv run mkdocs build --strict` (the strict build) checks only `.md` links.
- MkDocs renders Python-Markdown, not GitHub Markdown. A list therefore needs a preceding blank line and its sub-lists a 4-space indent, or they merge into the preceding paragraph.
